  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium high heat.",
    "Thread fromage blanc, cucumber, and red onion onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together lemon juice, white wine, and olive oil.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the skewers.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Grill the skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until slightly charred.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh dill.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
